		"_postman_id": "3c7e1a52-8d4b-4f0e-9b61-2a5f0d9c7e18",
		"name": "FawtraSmart Mobile — Stock (Node)",
		"description": "Stock section of the FawtraSmart mobile backend (Node.js / Express), base `{{base_url}}/api/v1`.\n\nSuggested order:\n1) Auth → Login (stores token)\n2) Warehouses → List Warehouses (stores warehouse_id)\n3) Permits → Create Data (stores warehouse_id and product_id), then Add Addition Permit (stores permit_id)\n4) Approval → Approve (or Reject), then Cancel Approval\n5) Price lists → Add Price List (stores price_list_id) → Add Product To List (stores item_id)\n\nEvery stock route needs the «إدارة المخزون» application enabled and the plan feature of its section (stock_storehouses / stock_warehouse_permits / stock_price_lists).\nRequest bodies are camelCase; permit lines are items: [{ productId, quantity, unitPrice, total }] — in multipart a JSON string or items[0][productId] ….\nEvery request sends Accept: application/json. Responses: { success, data } / { success, message, data }; errors: { success:false, error:{ code, message, details? } }.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
